the action items,

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.570
and actually doing the actions.

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.660
So what are the bits and
pieces that you're using here?

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:26.660
MOHAMED EL-GEISH: Right.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.920
So we're really
big on Kubernetes.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.940
It's something I have
