00:08:36.679 --> 00:08:37.770
It was really hard.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:38.720
It was very complex.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.870
And we understand
how life, right now,

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:44.210
for startups and
companies that are growing

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.190
is much busier than it used
to be like a decade ago.

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:50.270
So you can actually just
walk into your terminal,

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.550
and type in a few
commands, and voila, you

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:55.038
